#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:2
msgid "Training and Support"
msgstr "교육 및 지원"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:13
msgid ""
"Get the help you need with Mattermost via robust documentation, extensive"
" community support, and professional support services. If you're "
"struggling with something on your Mattermost journey, take a look at the "
"following learning resources:"
msgstr ""
"탄탄한 문서, 폭넓은 커뮤니티 지원, 전문적인 지원 서비스를 통해 OKR.BEST에 필요한 "
"도움을 받으세요. OKR.BEST 사용 중 어려움을 겪고 있다면 다음 학습 리소스를 "
"살펴보세요:"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:16
msgid "Training"
msgstr "교육"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:18
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Academy <https://academy.mattermost.com/>`__ - Get the most "
"out of your Mattermost experience by enrolling in free online customer "
"onboarding, end user, and administration courses for self-hosted "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost Academy <https://academy.mattermost.com/>`__ - 자체 호스팅 배포를 "
"위한 무료 온라인 고객 온보딩, 최종 사용자, 관리 과정에 등록하여 OKR.BEST를 최대한 "
"활용하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:21
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "문서"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:23
msgid ""
"`Mattermost product documentation <https://docs.mattermost.com/>`__ - "
"Read information for end users and administrators about deploying, "
"managing, and using Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost 제품 문서 <https://docs.mattermost.com/>`__ - 최종 사용자와 관리자를 "
"위한 Mattermost 배포, 관리, 사용 정보를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Mattermost developer documentation "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/>`__ - Read information for developer "
"community members about integrating, extending, customizing, and "
"contributing to Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost 개발자 문서 <https://developers.mattermost.com/>`__ - 개발자 커뮤니티 "
"구성원을 위한 Mattermost 통합, 확장, 커스터마이징, 기여 정보를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:25
msgid ""
"`Mattermost API reference <https://api.mattermost.com/>`__ - Read "
"information for developer community members about the Mattermost API used"
" by Mattermost clients and third-party applications."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost API 레퍼런스 <https://api.mattermost.com/>`__ - Mattermost "
"클라이언트와 서드파티 애플리케이션이 사용하는 Mattermost API 정보를 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:27
msgid ""
"We welcome :doc:`community contributions to this documentation </get-help"
"/contribute-to-documentation>`."
msgstr ""
"이 문서에 대한 :doc:`커뮤니티 기여 </get-help/contribute-to-documentation>`\\ 를 "
"환영합니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:30
msgid "Help Center"
msgstr "헬프 센터"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:32
msgid ""
"Visit the `Mattermost Help Center <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us>`_ to access frequently asked questions and common troubleshooting "
"tips."
msgstr ""
"자주 묻는 질문과 일반적인 문제 해결 팁은 `Mattermost 헬프 센터 "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us>`_ 페이지에서 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:35
msgid "Commercial Customer Support"
msgstr "상용 고객 지원"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:38
msgid "Enterprise"
msgstr "Enterprise"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:40
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Enterprise </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>` "
"support is available 24 x 7 at all times on all days through email and "
"the `Mattermost online ticketing system "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_ with a 4 hour "
"response time service-level target. For more information, please see "
"`Mattermost Support Terms <https://mattermost.com/support-terms/>`_."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mattermost Enterprise </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>` "
"지원은 이메일과 `Mattermost 온라인 티켓 시스템 "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new>`_\\ 을 통해 연중무휴 "
"24시간 제공되며, 응답 시간 서비스 수준 목표는 4시간입니다. 자세한 내용은 "
"`Mattermost 지원 약관 <https://mattermost.com/support-terms/>`_ 문서를 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:43
msgid "Premier"
msgstr "Premier"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:45
msgid ""
"Available as an additional purchase for Mattermost Enterprise customers, "
"Mattermost Premier Support offers additional license entitlements for "
"non-production environments, direct access to senior support team "
"members, screen-sharing and audio calling for Priority 1 and Priority 2 "
"tickets, and access to a private channel with Mattermost technical staff."
" For more information, please see `Mattermost Support Terms "
"<https://mattermost.com/support-terms/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost Enterprise 고객이 추가로 구매할 수 있는 Mattermost Premier 지원은 "
"비프로덕션 환경을 위한 추가 라이선스 권한, 시니어 지원 팀 구성원과의 직접 연결, "
"Priority 1·Priority 2 티켓에 대한 화면 공유와 음성 통화, Mattermost 기술 "
"직원과의 비공개 채널 이용을 제공합니다. 자세한 내용은 `Mattermost 지원 약관 "
"<https://mattermost.com/support-terms/>`_ 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:48
msgid "Professional"
msgstr "Professional"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Professional </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>`"
" support includes business hours support from 8am to 8pm United States "
"Pacific Time (UTC-8 except for U.S. daylight savings time, with next "
"business day response time via email and the Mattermost online ticketing "
"system. For more information, please see `Mattermost Support Terms "
"<https://mattermost.com/support-terms/>`_."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mattermost Professional </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>`"
" 지원은 미국 태평양 시간(UTC-8, 미국 서머타임 기간 제외) 기준 오전 8시부터 오후 "
"8시까지 업무 시간 지원을 포함하며, 이메일과 Mattermost 온라인 티켓 시스템을 통해 "
"다음 영업일까지 응답합니다. 자세한 내용은 `Mattermost 지원 약관 "
"<https://mattermost.com/support-terms/>`_ 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:53
msgid "Non-Commercial Support"
msgstr "비상용 지원"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:55
msgid ""
"Community support for :doc:`Mattermost Free </product-overview/editions-"
"and-offerings>` is available on the `peer-to-peer discussion forums "
"<https://forum.mattermost.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mattermost Free </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>` 에디션에 "
"대한 커뮤니티 지원은 `사용자 간 토론 포럼 <https://forum.mattermost.com/>`_\\ 에서 "
"제공됩니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:57
msgid ""
"Organizations using Mattermost Free to evaluate a future purchase of "
":doc:`Mattermost Enterprise </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>` "
"can talk to a `Mattermost Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`_ to apply for early access to commercial support as part of the "
"evaluation process."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost Free를 사용하면서 향후 :doc:`Mattermost Enterprise </product-"
"overview/editions-and-offerings>` 구매를 검토하는 조직은 `Mattermost 전문가 "
"<https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 와 상담하여 평가 과정의 일환으로 상용 "
"지원 조기 이용을 신청할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:60
msgid "Community server"
msgstr "커뮤니티 서버"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:62
msgid ""
"`Mattermost Community server <https://community.mattermost.com>`_ - "
"Connect with thousands of contributors, customers, and users to build, "
"share, and learn together. This server is our virtual office and is open "
"to everyone. Learn more about the many :doc:`channels you can join </get-"
"help/community-chat>` on the community server."
msgstr ""
"`Mattermost 커뮤니티 서버 <https://community.mattermost.com>`_ - 수천 명의 "
"기여자, 고객, 사용자와 연결되어 함께 만들고, 공유하고, 배우세요. 이 서버는 우리의 "
"가상 사무실이며 누구에게나 열려 있습니다. 커뮤니티 서버에서 :doc:`참여할 수 있는 "
"다양한 채널 </get-help/community-chat>`\\ 을 자세히 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:64
msgid ""
"Please review our `Code of Conduct "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/contributors/contributors/guidelines"
"/contribution-guidelines>`_ before participating."
msgstr ""
"참여하기 전에 `행동 강령 "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/contributors/contributors/guidelines"
"/contribution-guidelines>`_\\ 을 먼저 확인해 주세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:67
msgid "Mattermost user forums"
msgstr "Mattermost 사용자 포럼"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:69
msgid ""
"`Troubleshooting forum <https://forum.mattermost.com/c/trouble-"
"shoot/16>`_ - Join our community forum for peer-based technical support. "
"Please review our `Code of Conduct "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/contributors/contributors/guidelines"
"/contribution-guidelines>`_ before participating."
msgstr ""
"`문제 해결 포럼 <https://forum.mattermost.com/c/trouble-shoot/16>`_ - 사용자 간 "
"기술 지원을 위한 커뮤니티 포럼에 참여하세요. 참여하기 전에 `행동 강령 "
"<https://handbook.mattermost.com/contributors/contributors/guidelines"
"/contribution-guidelines>`_\\ 을 먼저 확인해 주세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:72
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "피드백"

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:74
msgid ""
"`Report a bug <https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/why-"
"contribute/#youve-found-a-bug>`_ - Report bugs or other issues you "
"encounter when using Mattermost to our development team."
msgstr ""
"`버그 신고 <https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/why-contribute"
"/#youve-found-a-bug>`_ - Mattermost 사용 중 발견한 버그나 기타 문제를 개발 팀에 "
"신고하세요."

#: ../../source/get-help/get-help-index.rst:75
msgid ""
"`Propose a feature <https://portal.productboard.com/mattermost/33-what-"
"matters-to-you>`_ - Vote for feature proposals or submit your own."
msgstr ""
"`기능 제안 <https://portal.productboard.com/mattermost/33-what-matters-to-"
"you>`_ - 기능 제안에 투표하거나 직접 아이디어를 제출하세요."

